# Welcome

**{% $product %}** keeps files in sync across workstations, servers and cloud storage – encrypted, versioned and entirely under your control. This guide covers installing, configuring and running version {% $product_version %}.

{% callout type="tip" title="Quick start" %}
Want to try {% $product %} first? Follow the [installation guide](installation.mdoc) – about five minutes later, your first folder is in sync.
{% /callout %}

