## Who this guide is for

This guide is written for administrators who roll out and operate {% $product %} across an organization. It assumes a basic understanding of networking and some familiarity with the command line.

## Conventions

| Style | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `nimbus status` | Commands, file names and configuration values |
| {% kbd keys="Ctrl+Shift+S" /%} | Keyboard shortcuts |
| {% badge color="green" %}Stable{% /badge %} {% badge color="yellow" %}Preview{% /badge %} | Maturity of a feature |
| *Italics* | Terms explained in the [glossary](faq.mdoc#glossary) |

